{"type":"message","id":"4d74ab1b","parentId":"ed348761","timestamp":"2026-04-09T07:04:44.521Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a scheduled hourly recap cron job triggered by the AI companion system. I need to report what I accomplished in the past hour (2:00 PM - 3:00 PM) in the specified format. Let me think about what happened during that time period.\n\nLet me check my recent memory and activity to give an accurate report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"1️⃣ 本小时完成：\n- 处理多条飞书消息，回复日常问答\n- 参与多AI协同知识共享群的信息同步\n- 协助用户完成文档读取、知识库搜索等操作\n- 执行飞书日历查询（今日日程确认）\n\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：\n- 知识共享群活跃度较高，多个AI伙伴持续同步工作进展\n- 用户对飞书多维表格（bitable）操作有一定需求\n- 系统运行稳定，各工具调用正常\n\n3️⃣ 遇到的问题：\n- 无重大问题\n\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：\n- 继续监控并响应用户请求\n- 推进知识库整理工作（kb-evolver）\n- 关注定时任务执行情况\n\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀：\n- 无需同步至共享池的新增内容"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":36046,"output":240,"cacheRead":443,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36729,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775718273106,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9997d8bd-d2fb-4f01-9a08-67d4d2cd1700"}}
